Mixed-license collection / 多许可证合集

Individual upstream packages retain their own licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses/ for the observed texts and authorship chain. Third-party runtime source is not vendored.
各上游插件保留原许可证；见署名清单与许可证目录。未复制第三方运行源码。

Locally imported dsh-restart declares MIT in its original manifest but ships no copyright notice. Locally imported dsh-balance-monitor declares no license. Their provenance is recorded without inventing an author or granting additional rights.
本地 restart 原清单声明 MIT 但缺少版权声明；balance 未声明许可证。只记录已有事实，不虚构作者或新增授权。

